# Image digests every run uses. A line moves only through a pull request, so
# each result records exactly what it ran against (design ch. 2.3, 6.2).
# The pds.js, ZDS and PLC digests start from HappyView's interop/images.env at
# 9f084f5c, so the first results are comparable with HappyView's interop runs.

